<view wx:if="{{!expanded}}" class="cg-shell page-shell"><view class="cg-kicker">FIELD NOTES · 现场优先</view><view class="cg-title">{{node.title}}</view><view class="cg-action">{{node.action}}</view><view wx:if="{{completed}}" class="cg-note">{{node.feedback}}</view><view class="cg-note">道具 · {{node.prop}}</view><view class="cg-note">可先看现场，再打开原有剧情与挑战。现场拥挤、看不清或没有道具，都可以继续。</view><button bindtap="toggle">打开剧情与可选挑战</button><button wx:if="{{guide}}" bindtap="deep">{{deep ? '收起基础介绍' : '基础介绍 · 文字'}}</button><view wx:if="{{deep}}"><view wx:for="{{guide.script}}" wx:key="index" class="cg-copy">{{item}}</view><view class="cg-note">沿用当前版本文稿；新增来源核验资料可在资料阅读中查看。</view></view><button bindtap="hint">{{hint ? '提示二' : '提示一'}}</button><view wx:if="{{hint}}" class="cg-note">{{node.hints[hint-1]}}</view><view class="cg-row"><button data-status="skipped" bindtap="advance" disabled="{{busy}}">跳过本题</button><button data-status="later" bindtap="advance" disabled="{{busy}}">稍后再做</button></view><view class="cg-note">不会计为答对，也不会补发日期卡。</view></view><view hidden="{{!expanded}}"><slot /></view><button wx:if="{{expanded}}" class="cg-collapse" bindtap="toggle">收起挑战</button>